  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowering Palestian Institutions and Civil Society - Public Financial Management TAF PFRC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Empowering Palestinian Institutions and Civil Society (EPICS) Public Financial Management (PFM) programme (FCDO/ PFRC, &#xa3;15m, 2024-27), aims to support the Palestinian Authority&apos;s (PA) A institutions and key departments within the Ministry of Finance to enhance their financial and tax governance capabilities. In particular, it will aim to strengthen its PFM and tax capabilities, with emphasis on building long-term independent capability for the PA. Technical assistance within the realm of PFM and revenue reform will focus on the development of legislation, strategic planning, policy development and implementation and will interest General Directorates of Budget, Budget Performance Management, Macro Fiscal Unit and the Revenue Authority.</narrative>
  </description>
